#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:41
#: 1401557635ae4076924eb0993844c4f2
msgid ""
"The map will only show the current position when you have GPS lock or are "
"using a flight simulator"
msgstr "只有在 GPS 锁定或使用飞行仿真器时，地图才会显示当前位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:42
#: d5efeca6ac5c4affa830ab7abb62ad95
msgid ""
"Remember how artificial horizons work: when the aircraft tilts to the right,"
" the horizon tilts to the left. Just tilt your head and you will understand."
msgstr "请记住人工地平线的工作原理：飞行器向右倾斜时，地平线向左倾斜。歪头看就能明白。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:43
#: fffeca4e8b6449cd9b07a4fac2ac0bc1
msgid ""
"You can issues mode changes and other action commands in the air with the "
"Mission Planner and other GCSs, but note that you must be under autopilot "
"control for them to take effect. When your RC toggle switch is in the Manual"
" position, you are no longer under autopilot control and no commands will "
"take effect. You must be in one of the other positions (Stabilize, Fly-by-"
"Wire, Auto, or any other autopilot-controlled mode) for MAVLink commands to "
"take effect."
msgstr ""
"您可以在飞行过程中通过 Mission Planner 及其他 GCS "
"发送模式切换和其他动作指令，但请注意，必须处于飞控控制状态下指令才能生效。当遥控切换开关处于 Manual "
"位置时，飞控不再控制飞行器，任何指令均无效。必须处于其他位置之一（Stabilize、Fly-by-Wire、Auto "
"或其他飞控受控模式），MAVLink 指令才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:44
#: 47005a62bfa5492d9c306a6323689d5a
msgid ""
"You can change the voice used in the speech synthesis in the Ease of Access "
"center in Windows Control Panel. Go to the \"Text to Speech\" options."
msgstr "您可以在 Windows 控制面板的「轻松访问中心」中更改语音合成所用的声音，进入「文本转语音」选项即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:45
#: 13bcc85cda614ab6bc687a5233a6eb48
msgid ""
"If you double-click the HUD it will popout, allowing you to run the HUD full"
" screen on a second screen."
msgstr "双击 HUD 可将其弹出，从而在第二块屏幕上全屏运行 HUD。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:46
#: 5e0a0b411f0241f287446ca4ec064e19
msgid "Below the HUD are several buttons for actions, status, etc."
msgstr "HUD 下方有几个用于操作、状态等的按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:47
#: 4a1676043fd04dfc9701bead54e333ce
msgid ""
"If you enable the Tuning checkbox at the bottom of the map, and then double-"
"click the tuning window that appears, you can graph any data that is "
"available in the Status tab under the HUD. This means you can have alt, "
"attitude, or many other options shown in real-time."
msgstr ""
"如果勾选地图底部的「Tuning」复选框，然后双击弹出的调参窗口，即可实时绘制 HUD "
"下方「Status」标签页中任何可用数据的图表，包括高度、姿态等多种选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:48
#: e9c1c9ef393e4d5b88a004b5b44ffc00
msgid ""
"You can use custom imagery instead of Google Maps. Press control-F. This "
"allows you to upload your own orthophotos. This will require Globalmapper, "
"as this is currently one of the key steps in exporting in the required "
"format for use in the planner."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用自定义影像代替 Google Maps，按下 Ctrl+F 即可，这允许上传自己的正射影像。此操作需要 "
"Globalmapper，因为这是以规划器所需格式导出的关键步骤之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:52
#: be1081d1f7324b2fb0e67e9f2c08e3f4
msgid "For more details about the Flight Data Screen, see:"
msgstr "有关飞行数据画面的更多详情，请参见："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:60
#: 37cfd36e099048a1a29cbd281b6ebcc0
msgid "Guided Mode"
msgstr "Guided 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:65
#: cd9f2bb944364fc2b62c9fbe26f606f3
msgid ""
"One of the most commonly-used features in pro UAVs is point-and-click "
"mission control in real-time. Rather than just pre-planned missions or "
"manually flying the UAV, operators can just click on a map and say \"go here"
" now\" which is a feature available in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"专业 UAV 中最常用的功能之一，是实时点击地图控制任务。操作员无需预先规划任务或手动驾驶 "
"UAV，只需在地图上点击并下达「立即飞往此处」的指令，这一功能在 Mission Planner 中已提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:67
#: ca5941b8bc71416aab389aa55342aa55
msgid ""
"On the Mission Planner Flight Data map, you can right-click on the map and "
"just select \"Fly To Here\". The UAV will fly there and loiter until you "
"give it another command. ArduPilot calls this \"Guided Mode\"."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 飞行数据地图上，右键单击地图并选择「Fly To Here」，UAV "
"将飞至该位置并盘旋，直到收到下一条指令。ArduPilot 将此称为「Guided 模式」。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-ground-control-station.rst:69
#: 027ddd850c67456ebad47c65258ee040
msgid ""
"Guided is a separate flight mode. If you enter it you will remain in it "
"until you do something to change modes. So if you tell it to \"go here "
"now\", once it arrives there it will loiter at the Guided waypoint till you "
"tell it to do something else. Something else could either be going to "
"another Guided waypoint (staying in Guided mode) or changing to some other "
"flight mode. If you change to Auto your mission will resume where it left "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Guided 是一种独立的飞行模式。进入该模式后，将持续保持，直到您主动切换模式。因此，若下达「立即飞往此处」的指令，飞行器到达目的地后将在 "
"Guided 航点盘旋，直到收到新指令。新指令可以是前往另一个 Guided 航点（继续保持 Guided 模式），或切换到其他飞行模式。切换到 "
"Auto 模式后，任务将从中断处继续执行。"

